# osTicket Help Desk Deployment Lab

## Overview

This project documents the deployment and configuration of an **osTicket help desk environment** using Microsoft Azure, Windows, Internet Information Services (IIS), PHP, MySQL, and HeidiSQL.

The lab demonstrates hands-on experience with virtual machine deployment, Windows administration, web server configuration, PHP application deployment, database configuration, file permissions, and help desk platform installation.

The purpose of this project is to demonstrate practical IT infrastructure and application deployment skills that are relevant to entry-level help desk and IT support roles.

